  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening monitoring and financing capacity to accelerate the implementation of the SDGs and national priorities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Despite its abundant natural assets and biodiversity, Papua New Guinea faces significant development challenges as a poor extractive-based economy. These challenges include limitedprogress toward achieving the Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs), inadequate financingfor the Medium-Term Development Plan IV (MTDP IV), and ineffective monitoring mechanismsfor tracking progress. The project aims to support the implementation of the MTDP IV with a keyfocus on the 10th Strategic Priority Area (SPA)-C</narrative>
  </description>
